# Address of the backend the site talks to (no trailing slash needed).
# Used by "npm run build" through .env.production. In development leave it unset to use the local proxy in vite.config.js,
# or set it in a .env.local file (not committed) to point the dev site at another backend.
VITE_API_URL=https://thugilcreation-backend.kaiira.in
